meta {
  name: Begin two-factor setup
  type: http
  seq: 9
}

post {
  url: {{host}}/api/auth/2fa/enable
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
}

body:json {
  {
    "methods": [
      "App"
    ],
    "currentPassword": "{{adminPassword}}"
  }
}

docs {
  UC-36. Authenticated, always on the caller themselves.

  currentPassword is the caller's own password and is required: a missing or wrong one answers 401 "The password or code is incorrect.", the answer every re-authentication shares. Five failures within fifteen minutes pause these checks for the account for fifteen minutes, with the same answer.

  methods is any of "App", "Email", or both. Setup stays inactive until confirmed. When App is selected the answer carries an otpauth:// URI to enrol in an authenticator app.
}
